  ],
  "notes": "Defaults create bucket/KMS/OAC/WAF/distribution; domain-gated ACM and Route 53 resources are checked as declared. Not checked: the non-empty hosted zone requirement (a variable validation/precondition is invisible or varies), the fallback bucket name prefix \"webapp-template-\" and name-variable fallback (held in locals), us-east-1 provider alias for ACM (provider config invisible), variable names (prompt names none). Policy checks bind GetObject/SourceArn to a policy document that grants s3:GetObject, so the KMS key policy's CloudFront SourceArn condition cannot satisfy them; the document's attachment to the bucket policy is a second hop that cannot be expressed. www_flag matches the boolean by the word 'www' in its name (the alias list is built in a local in the GT). DSV4F fails sni_only/tls_min: its only visible viewer_certificate is a dynamic block for the default certificate. The adapter keeps one dynamic block per block name, so a second (custom-cert) dynamic block may have been dropped; not verifiable without the source, so the checks are kept."
}